"hash_xxh64":"0x31D746C4ED716A8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320703011:1":{"text":"여긴 온천 아니면 눈인데, 눈을 보낼 순 없잖아요.","source_cn":"这里除了温泉就是雪，我总不能寄一捧雪回去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FA1D06C21527069","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320703013:1":{"text":"바닥 걸레질도 못 했고, 욕조도 아직 못 닦았어요. 해야 할 일이 너무 많아서 시간을 내기가 힘드네요.","source_cn":"地板还没拖，池子也还没刷，没做完的工作太多了，我抽不开身。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CBB9A5183DA6DDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320703014:0":{"text":"아니면 선물할 만한 특산품이 있는지 같이 마을을 한 번 둘러볼 수도 있을 텐데.","source_cn":"要不然，我们可以一起去镇上逛逛，看看有什么适合当礼物的特产？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45885C6D1E0A12DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320703015:0":{"text":"그러고 보니, 좀 쉬어야 할 때가 된 것 같네요.","source_cn":"说起来，你是该休假了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0BE9230282D993F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320703016:1":{"text":"앗, 게르다 부인! 물건 들이러 가신 것 아니셨나요?","source_cn":"哎呀，格尔达！你不是去进货了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x003A6F760FEE2D76","variant_status":"","mal